"IMPLEMENTED (2026-08-12): SIZE + MORALE/INTIMIDATION. Stats: size + morale i8 stats in StatBlock (bodies: human 0/5, bandit 0/4, slime -2/3, bat -4/5, wolf -1/3, elementals -3/4, giant test body 6; traits tiny -4/small -1/big +1/huge +3 size, huge +2 morale). Runtime: SizeComponent + MoraleComponent{morale,max_morale} applied from totals (max pattern mirrors mhp). Effects: ActionEffect::Intimidate(i16) (authorable -- a roar is just this) + Rally(RallyEffect{ep_cost,morale}) (SATS newtype). IMPLICIT RIDER: action_system broadcasts one EARLY event per co-located non-ally with morale, magnitude = max(0, size delta) + round's authored Intimidate sum -- every round of every action intimidates, fear resolves before the same tick's blows. BREAK: magnitude > effective morale (best nerve among co-located faction, self incl.) forces the registered cowering stance (SpecialStanceKey::Cowering registry, resolved at push from AssetPack.cowering_stance_name -- no name sniffing), cancels active+queued actions regardless of interruptibility, drains morale by the magnitude (floor 0), sets cowered flag. Already-cowered victims are NOT re-broken (no action-lock; they can rally and crawl). EXIT GATE: set_stance while cowered requires effective morale > looming_pressure (max positive size delta among co-located non-allies) -- out-nerve it or flee it; clears the flag. RALLY: ep >= cost -> ep spent, morale restored capped at max (first real EP sink). Helpers effective_morale/looming_pressure on EntityHandleExtension. Content: cowering stance (hand -2 atk/def -1 gait -1, grants rally), rally action, heavies author Intimidate on telegraphs (boppity_bop/smash 1, cleave/lunge/fire_bolt 2, slime_spray 1). Client: morale subscribed + Morale line in stats; PLUS user asks folded in: push-assets button removed (auto-push once on admin attach, failures surfaced), AccountPanel responsive two-section layout (wide: create|login, narrow: login above create). e2e phase 10-morale (4 tests, giant-vs-mouse: break+drain, refusal under pressure, rally economy, flee-and-stand); registered test-e2e-morale. Full gate green: cargo, clippy 0, check, 105 unit, e2e 0-10; dev instance reseeded. Deferred: enemy rally AI (cowered enemies stay down -- enemy controller cannot self-target buffs), morale regen over time, intimidation observability in the event feed."